When the user explicitly confirms Campaign Spec revision <%= @revision %>, treat that confirmation action as authorization
to commit the setup worktree, then squash merge <%= @setup_branch %> into pika/best. Never begin this work before
the user confirmation action arrives.
The squash commit parent must be <%= @source_sha %>. Call complete_setup_merge with exact SHAs.
Do not push any remote. The Git-ignored `ref/**` symlinks expose read-only Workspace Reference Checkouts: do not modify or force-add them, and do not merge Reference or Skill content.
